k": 14464, "start": 149.7, "end": 151.1, "text": " And they marveled at him.", "tokens": [50618, 400, 436, 23893, 292, 412, 796, 13, 50688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14631561839252438, "compression_ratio": 1.7118644067796611, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016074755694717169}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14464, "start": 151.66, "end": 157.29999999999998, "text": " And Sadducees came to him, who say that there is no resurrection, and they asked him a question,", "tokens": [50716, 400, 12269, 769, 384, 279, 1361, 281, 796, 11, 567, 584, 300, 456, 307, 572, 24150, 11, 293, 436, 2351, 796, 257, 1168, 11, 50998], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14631561839252438, "compression_ratio": 1.7118644067796611, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016074755694717169}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14464, "start": 157.55999999999997, "end": 165.35999999999999, "text": " saying, Teacher, Moses wrote for us that if a man's brother dies and leaves a wife, but", "tokens": [51011, 1566, 11, 19745, 11, 17580, 4114, 337, 505, 300, 498, 257, 587, 311, 3708, 2714, 293, 5510, 257, 3836, 11, 457, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14631561839252438, "compression_ratio": 1.7118644067796611, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016074755694717169}, {"id": 44, "seek": 14464, "start": 165.35999999999999, "end": 171.11999999999998, "text": " leaves no child, the man must take the widow and raise up offspring for his brother.", "tokens": [51401, 5510, 572, 1440, 11, 264, 587, 1633, 747, 264, 37207, 293, 5300, 493, 36857, 337, 702, 3708, 13, 51689], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14631561839252438, "compression_ratio": 1.7118644067796611, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016074755694717169}, {"id": 45, "seek": 14464, "start": 172.07999999999998, "end": 174.22, "text": " There were seven brothers.", "tokens": [51737, 821, 645, 3407, 8452, 13, 51844], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14631561839252438, "compression_ratio": 1.7118644067796611, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016074755694717169}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17464, "start": 174.64, "end": 178.94, "text": " The first took a wife, and when he died, left no offspring.", "tokens": [50365, 440, 700, 1890, 257, 3836, 11, 293, 562, 415, 4539, 11, 1411, 572, 36857, 13, 50580], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17464, "start": 179.72, "end": 183.32, "text": " And the second took her and died, leaving no offspring.", "tokens": [50619, 400, 264, 1150, 1890, 720, 293, 4539, 11, 5012, 572, 36857, 13, 50799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17464, "start": 183.85999999999999, "end": 185.42, "text": " And the third likewise.", "tokens": [50826, 400, 264, 2636, 32407, 13, 50904], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17464, "start": 186.35999999999999, "end": 188.72, "text": " And the seven left no offspring.", "tokens": [50951, 400, 264, 3407, 1411, 572, 36857, 13, 51069], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 50, "seek": 17464, "start": 189.42, "end": 192.23999999999998, "text": " Last of all, the woman also died.", "tokens": [51104, 5264, 295, 439, 11, 264, 3059, 611, 4539, 13, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 51, "seek": 17464, "start": 192.98, "end": 199.1, "text": " In the resurrection, when they rise again, whose wife will she be?", "tokens": [51282, 682, 264, 24150, 11, 562, 436, 6272, 797, 11, 6104, 3836, 486, 750, 312, 30, 51588], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 52, "seek": 17464, "start": 199.5, "end": 201.66, "text": " For the seven had her as wife.", "tokens": [51608, 1171, 264, 3407, 632, 720, 382, 3836, 13, 51716], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 53, "seek": 17464, "start": 202.07999999999998, "end": 203.35999999999999, "text": " Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [51737, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51801], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21690833314936211, "compression_ratio": 1.7419354838709677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0015330325113609433}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20336, "start": 203.36, "end": 205.92000000000002, "text": " Is this not the reason you are wrong?", "tokens": [50365, 1119, 341, 406, 264, 1778, 291, 366, 2085, 30, 50493], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20336, "start": 206.3, "end": 209.64000000000001, "text": " Because you know neither the Scriptures nor the power of God.", "tokens": [50512, 1436, 291, 458, 9662, 264, 46522, 6051, 264, 1347, 295, 1265, 13, 50679], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20336, "start": 210.52, "end": 214.46, "text": " For when they rise from the dead, they neither marry nor are given in marriage,", "tokens": [50723, 1171, 562, 436, 6272, 490, 264, 3116, 11, 436, 9662, 9747, 6051, 366, 2212, 294, 7194, 11, 50920], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20336, "start": 214.78, "end": 216.44000000000003, "text": " but are like angels in heaven.", "tokens": [50936, 457, 366, 411, 18175, 294, 7162, 13, 51019], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 58, "seek": 20336, "start": 216.96, "end": 220.96, "text": " And as for the dead being raised, have you not read in the book of Moses,", "tokens": [51045, 400, 382, 337, 264, 3116, 885, 6005, 11, 362, 291, 406, 1401, 294, 264, 1446, 295, 17580, 11, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 59, "seek": 20336, "start": 221.3, "end": 224.60000000000002, "text": " in the passage about the bush, how God spoke to him, saying,", "tokens": [51262, 294, 264, 11497, 466, 264, 19910, 11, 577, 1265, 7179, 281, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 51427], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 60, "seek": 20336, "start": 225.04000000000002, "end": 229.68, "text": " I am the God of Abraham, and the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob?", "tokens": [51449, 286, 669, 264, 1265, 295, 17782, 11, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 22505, 11, 293, 264, 1265, 295, 14117, 30, 51681], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 61, "seek": 20336, "start": 230.36, "end": 232.64000000000001, "text": " He is not God of the dead,", "tokens": [51715, 634, 307, 406, 1265, 295, 264, 3116, 11, 51829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14779075374448203, "compression_ratio": 1.743083003952569, "no_speech_prob": 0.02941618300974369}, {"id": 62, "seek": 23264, "start": 232.64, "end": 233.79999999999998, "text": " but of the living.", "tokens": [50365, 457, 295, 264, 2647, 13, 50423], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 63, "seek": 23264, "start": 234.72, "end": 236.23999999999998, "text": " You are quite wrong.", "tokens": [50469, 509, 366, 1596, 2085, 13, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 64, "seek": 23264, "start": 237.07999999999998, "end": 240.6, "text": " And one of the scribes came up and heard them disputing with one another,", "tokens": [50587, 400, 472, 295, 264, 39435, 279, 1361, 493, 293, 2198, 552, 37669, 278, 365, 472, 1071, 11, 50763], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 65, "seek": 23264, "start": 240.88, "end": 243.57999999999998, "text": " and seeing that he answered them well, asked him,", "tokens": [50777, 293, 2577, 300, 415, 10103, 552, 731, 11, 2351, 796, 11, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 66, "seek": 23264, "start": 244.29999999999998, "end": 247.42, "text": " Which commandment is the most important of all?", "tokens": [50948, 3013, 5622, 518, 307, 264, 881, 1021, 295, 439, 30, 51104], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 67, "seek": 23264, "start": 248.11999999999998, "end": 249.2, "text": " Jesus answered,", "tokens": [51139, 2705, 10103, 11, 51193], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 68, "seek": 23264, "start": 249.89999999999998, "end": 251.2, "text": " The most important is,", "tokens": [51228, 440, 881, 1021, 307, 11, 51293], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 69, "seek": 23264, "start": 251.92, "end": 255.89999999999998, "text": " Hear, O Israel, the Lord our God, the Lord is one,", "tokens": [51329, 30685, 11, 422, 5674, 11, 264, 3257, 527, 1265, 11, 264, 3257, 307, 472, 11, 51528], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 70, "seek": 23264, "start": 256.38, "end": 259.58, "text": " and you shall love the Lord your God with all your heart,", "tokens": [51552, 293, 291, 4393, 959, 264, 3257, 428, 1265, 365, 439, 428, 1917, 11, 51712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 71, "seek": 23264, "start": 259.58, "end": 262.4, "text": " and with all your soul, and with all your mind,", "tokens": [51712, 293, 365, 439, 428, 5133, 11, 293, 365, 439, 428, 1575, 11, 51853], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.177249051756778, "compression_ratio": 1.8008849557522124, "no_speech_prob": 0.0013778129359707236}, {"id": 72, "seek": 26240, "start": 262.4, "end": 263.73999999999995, "text": " and with all your strength.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 365, 439, 428, 3800, 13, 50432], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 73, "seek": 26240, "start": 264.35999999999996, "end": 265.76, "text": " The second is this,", "tokens": [50463, 440, 1150, 307, 341, 11, 50533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 74, "seek": 26240, "start": 266.34, "end": 268.41999999999996, "text": " You shall love your neighbor as yourself.", "tokens": [50562, 509, 4393, 959, 428, 5987, 382, 1803, 13, 50666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 75, "seek": 26240, "start": 269.29999999999995, "end": 272.26, "text": " There is no other commandment greater than these.", "tokens": [50710, 821, 307, 572, 661, 5622, 518, 5044, 813, 613, 13, 50858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 76, "seek": 26240, "start": 272.67999999999995, "end": 274.34, "text": " And the scribe said to him,", "tokens": [50879, 400, 264, 5545, 650, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50962], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 77, "seek": 26240, "start": 274.96, "end": 276.41999999999996, "text": " You are right, teacher.", "tokens": [50993, 509, 366, 558, 11, 5027, 13, 51066], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 78, "seek": 26240, "start": 276.88, "end": 281.62, "text": " You have truly said that he is one, and there is no other besides him.", "tokens": [51089, 509, 362, 4908, 848, 300, 415, 307, 472, 11, 293, 456, 307, 572, 661, 11868, 796, 13, 51326], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 79, "seek": 26240, "start": 282.02, "end": 285.76, "text": " And to love him with all the heart, and with all the understanding,", "tokens": [51346, 400, 281, 959, 796, 365, 439, 264, 1917, 11, 293, 365, 439, 264, 3701, 11, 51533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 80, "seek": 26240, "start": 285.85999999999996, "end": 289.53999999999996, "text": " and with all the strength, and to love one's neighbor as oneself,", "tokens": [51538, 293, 365, 439, 264, 3800, 11, 293, 281, 959, 472, 311, 5987, 382, 32265, 11, 51722], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 81, "seek": 26240, "start": 289.7, "end": 292.38, "text": " is much more than all whole burnt-out,", "tokens": [51730, 307, 709, 544, 813, 439, 1379, 18901, 12, 346, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21635525285705062, "compression_ratio": 1.8831168831168832, "no_speech_prob": 0.00017506731091998518}, {"id": 82, "seek": 29240, "start": 292.5, "end": 294.65999999999997, "text": " and is much more than all the offerings and sacrifices.", "tokens": [50370, 293, 307, 709, 544, 813, 439, 264, 25898, 293, 25094, 13, 50478], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 83, "seek": 29240, "start": 294.65999999999997, "end": 298.03999999999996, "text": " And when Jesus saw that he answered wisely, he said to him,", "tokens": [50478, 400, 562, 2705, 1866, 300, 415, 10103, 37632, 11, 415, 848, 281, 796, 11, 50647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 84, "seek": 29240, "start": 298.73999999999995, "end": 301.29999999999995, "text": " You are not far from the kingdom of God.", "tokens": [50682, 509, 366, 406, 1400, 490, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 13, 50810], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 85, "seek": 29240, "start": 301.94, "end": 305.59999999999997, "text": " And after that, no one dared to ask him any more questions.", "tokens": [50842, 400, 934, 300, 11, 572, 472, 44564, 281, 1029, 796, 604, 544, 1651, 13, 51025], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 86, "seek": 29240, "start": 307.59999999999997, "end": 310.15999999999997, "text": " And as Jesus taught in the temple, he said,", "tokens": [51125, 400, 382, 2705, 5928, 294, 264, 10184, 11, 415, 848, 11, 51253], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 87, "seek": 29240, "start": 310.88, "end": 314.47999999999996, "text": " How can the scribe say that the Christ is the son of David?", "tokens": [51289, 1012, 393, 264, 5545, 650, 584, 300, 264, 2040, 307, 264, 1872, 295, 4389, 30, 51469], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 88, "seek": 29240, "start": 315.08, "end": 317.76, "text": " David himself in the Holy Spirit declared,", "tokens": [51499, 4389, 3647, 294, 264, 6295, 7218, 15489, 11, 51633], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 89, "seek": 29240, "start": 317.76, "end": 319.67999999999995, "text": " The Lord said to my Lord,", "tokens": [51633, 440, 3257, 848, 281, 452, 3257, 11, 51729], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 90, "seek": 29240, "start": 320.06, "end": 322.28, "text": " Sit at my right hand until I put your enemies,", "tokens": [51748, 14523, 412, 452, 558, 1011, 1826, 286, 829, 428, 7805, 11, 51859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.32125628789265953, "compression_ratio": 1.6390977443609023, "no_speech_prob": 0.007443803828209639}, {"id": 91, "seek": 32240, "start": 322.4, "end": 323.15999999999997, "text": " under your feet.", "tokens": [50365, 833, 428, 3521, 13, 50403], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 92, "seek": 32240, "start": 323.62, "end": 325.67999999999995, "text": " David himself calls him Lord.", "tokens": [50426, 4389, 3647, 5498, 796, 3257, 13, 50529], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 93, "seek": 32240, "start": 326.23999999999995, "end": 328.26, "text": " So how is he his son?", "tokens": [50557, 407, 577, 307, 415, 702, 1872, 30, 50658], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 94, "seek": 32240, "start": 329.08, "end": 331.23999999999995, "text": " And the great throng heard him gladly.", "tokens": [50699, 400, 264, 869, 739, 556, 2198, 796, 47307, 13, 50807], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 95, "seek": 32240, "start": 331.82, "end": 333.41999999999996, "text": " And in his teaching he said,", "tokens": [50836, 400, 294, 702, 4571, 415, 848, 11, 50916], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 96, "seek": 32240, "start": 334.2, "end": 338.06, "text": " Beware of the scribes who like to walk around in long robes,", "tokens": [50955, 879, 3039, 295, 264, 39435, 279, 567, 411, 281, 1792, 926, 294, 938, 3870, 279, 11, 51148], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 97, "seek": 32240, "start": 338.29999999999995, "end": 340.17999999999995, "text": " and like greetings in the marketplaces,", "tokens": [51160, 293, 411, 33667, 294, 264, 2142, 34840, 11, 51254], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 98, "seek": 32240, "start": 340.5, "end": 342.84, "text": " and have the best seats in the synagogues,", "tokens": [51270, 293, 362, 264, 1151, 11069, 294, 264, 5451, 31599, 1247, 11, 51387], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 99, "seek": 32240, "start": 342.96, "end": 345.4, "text": " and the places of honor at feasts,", "tokens": [51393, 293, 264, 3190, 295, 5968, 412, 579, 20765, 11, 51515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 100, "seek": 32240, "start": 345.4, "end": 347.7, "text": " who devour widows' houses,", "tokens": [51515, 567, 1905, 396, 5274, 1509, 6, 8078, 11, 51630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 101, "seek": 32240, "start": 347.91999999999996, "end": 349.94, "text": " and for a pretense make long prayers.", "tokens": [51641, 293, 337, 257, 659, 39595, 652, 938, 16860, 13, 51742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 102, "seek": 32240, "start": 351.08, "end": 352.26, "text": " They will receive,", "tokens": [51799, 814, 486, 4774, 11, 51858], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2104530024334667, "compression_ratio": 1.6556016597510372, "no_speech_prob": 0.09427138417959213}, {"id": 103, "seek": 35240, "start": 352.4, "end": 353.96, "text": " the greater condemnation.", "tokens": [50365, 264, 5044, 30733, 399, 13, 50443], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 104, "seek": 35240, "start": 355.65999999999997, "end": 358.06, "text": " And he sat down opposite the treasury,", "tokens": [50528, 400, 415, 3227, 760, 6182, 264, 47213, 11, 50648], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 105, "seek": 35240, "start": 358.32, "end": 361.02, "text": " and watched the people putting money into the offering box.", "tokens": [50661, 293, 6337, 264, 561, 3372, 1460, 666, 264, 8745, 2424, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 106, "seek": 35240, "start": 361.85999999999996, "end": 363.64, "text": " Many rich people put in large sums,", "tokens": [50838, 5126, 4593, 561, 829, 294, 2416, 34499, 11, 50927], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 107, "seek": 35240, "start": 364.08, "end": 367.53999999999996, "text": " and a poor widow came and put in two small copper coins,", "tokens": [50949, 293, 257, 4716, 37207, 1361, 293, 829, 294, 732, 1359, 15007, 13561, 11, 51122], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 108, "seek": 35240, "start": 367.79999999999995, "end": 368.58, "text": " which make a penny.", "tokens": [51135, 597, 652, 257, 24178, 13, 51174], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 109, "seek": 35240, "start": 369.32, "end": 372.06, "text": " And he called his disciples to him and said to them,", "tokens": [51211, 400, 415, 1219, 702, 17209, 281, 796, 293, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51348], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 110, "seek": 35240, "start": 372.41999999999996, "end": 374.15999999999997, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [51366, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 51453], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 111, "seek": 35240, "start": 374.32, "end": 379.0, "text": " this poor widow has put in more than all those who are contributing to the offering box.", "tokens": [51461, 341, 4716, 37207, 575, 829, 294, 544, 813, 439, 729, 567, 366, 19270, 281, 264, 8745, 2424, 13, 51695], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 112, "seek": 35240, "start": 379.71999999999997, "end": 381.79999999999995, "text": " For they all contributed out of their abundance,", "tokens": [51731, 1171, 436, 439, 18434, 484, 295, 641, 23391, 11, 51835], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.225564562041184, "compression_ratio": 1.7364341085271318, "no_speech_prob": 0.010940201580524445}, {"id": 113, "seek": 38240, "start": 382.4, "end": 386.38, "text": " but she out of her poverty has put in everything she had,", "tokens": [50365, 457, 750, 484, 295, 720, 10958, 575, 829, 294, 1203, 750, 632, 11, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.4883761899224643, "compression_ratio": 1.0987654320987654, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020605132449418306}, {"id": 114, "seek": 38240, "start": 386.73999999999995, "end": 388.4, "text": " all she had to live on.", "tokens": [50582, 439, 750, 632, 281, 1621, 322, 13, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.4883761899224643, "compression_ratio": 1.0987654320987654, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020605132449418306}, {"id": 115, "seek": 38240, "start": 393.73999999999995, "end": 398.73999999999995, "text": " The End", "tokens": [50932, 440, 6967, 51182], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.4883761899224643, "compression_ratio": 1.0987654320987654, "no_speech_prob": 0.0020605132449418306}], "language": "English"}